WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.587
The project note describes a paper delivery and a deadline at the printer.

00:00:05.587 --> 00:00:10.215
Beside saves the preference for opening a project update with background.

00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:13.292
Change the order to risk first and decision second.

00:00:13.292 --> 00:00:23.112
